{"strongs": "H8469", "word": "תַּחֲנוּן", "translit": "ta.cha.nun", "root": "חנך", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [maculine]", "gloss": "supplication for favour", "definition": "תַּחֲנוּן noun [maculine] only plural abstract supplication for favour ; — absolute תַּחֲנוּנִים Prov 18:23 + 4 t.; construct תַּחֲנוּנֵי Jer 3:21 ; 2Chr 6:21 suffix 1 singular תַּחֲנוּנַי Ps 28:2 etc., + 9 t. suffix; also תַּחֲנוּנוֺתָ֑י Ps 86:6 — 1. made to men: ׳ דִּבֶּר ת (a poor man to the rich) Prov 18:23 אֵל ׳ ת supplication unto (crocodile to man) Job 40:27 elsewhere 2. to God: || תפלה Ps 143:1 ; Dan 9:3 ; Dan 9:17 אשׁר התפלל ׳ ת 2Chr 6:21 (= תחנה 1Kgs 8:30 ); ׳ קוֺל ת voice of supplication Ps 28:2 ; Ps 28:6 ; Ps 31:23 ; Ps 86:6 ; Ps 130:2 ; Ps 140:7 , also Ps 116:2 (for קוֺלִי is old case-ending, and construct as ᵐ5 ᵑ9 Che Bae and others); || בְּכִי Jer 31:9 ׳ בְּכִּי ת Jer 3:21 ׳ רוח חן ות Zech 12:10 לְפָנֶיךָ ׳ אֲנַחְנוּ מַפִּילִים ת Dan 9:18 we are presenting our supplications before thee ; ׳ בִּתְחִלַּת ת Dan 9:23 at the beginning of thy supplication .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2955')\">BDB2955</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8469')\">H8469</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2954')\">BDB2954</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2956')\">BDB2956</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תַּחֲנוּן</bdbheb> <b>noun [maculine]</b> only <b>plural abstract</b> <highlightword>supplication for favour</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>תַּחֲנוּנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 18:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,23)\">Prov 18:23</ref> + 4 t.; construct <bdbheb>תַּחֲנוּנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 3:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,21)\">Jer 3:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,21)\">2Chr 6:21</ref> suffix 1 singular <bdbheb>תַּחֲנוּנַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 